ys, Zombies & Alcoholism!","vodIds":["z59F5mmGGK0"]},{"chapterIds":[],"clipCount":18,"date":"2024-08-09","firstChapter":null,"href":"#page=stream&date=2024-08-09","people":[],"title":"I Detect a Social Deduction Game Among Us.  (feat. @GassyMexican, @SeaNanners, @BruceGreene, @Sp00nerism & @ZeRoyalViking)","vodIds":[]},{"chapterIds":["alone_in_the_dark_3_006_bank_train_station","alone_in_the_dark_3_007_cougar_resurrection","alone_in_the_dark_3_008_doppelganger_underground_mine","alone_in_the_dark_3_009_radioactive_lab_spider","alone_in_the_dark_3_010_cobra_emily_jed_stone"],"clipCount":8,"date":"2024-09-24","firstChapter":{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_3_006_bank_train_station","playHref":"#game=alone-in-the-dark-3&chapter=alone_in_the_dark_3_006_bank_train_station&watch=1&segment=0","title":"Bank & Train Station"},"href":"#page=stream&date=2024-09-24","people":[],"title":"Steam library A-Z take me clear back to 1995...","vodIds":["pNLUEcGoASs"]}],"tags":["Action","Exploration","Horror","Inventory Management","Puzzle","Singleplayer","Story","Supernatural","Survival Horror","Western"],"title":"Alone in the Dark 3","watchData":{"description":"A three-session archive of Sark's 1995 Western-horror run: a brief first look after finishing Alone in the Dark 2, followed by a fresh Slaughter Gulch playthrough that continues through Carnby's bizarre resurrection, the radioactive underground complex, Emily Hartwood's rescue, and the final showdown with Jed Stone.","groups":[{"chapters":[{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_3_001_first_look_slaughter_gulch","segments":[{"endSeconds":31492,"label":"Immediately after completing Alone in the Dark 2, Sark watches the third game's earthquake-and-film-set intro, jumps ahead to 1995, starts a new game, explores the opening stretch of Slaughter Gulch, tests the combat and search mechanics, and deliberately stops after a short preview","startSeconds":30636,"videoId":"YOu1CNUsujQ"}],"title":"A Quick Look at Slaughter Gulch"}],"id":"alone-in-the-dark-3-first-look","title":"First Look"},{"chapters":[{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_3_002_saloon_cellar_jail","segments":[{"endSeconds":6556,"label":"A fresh full run begins with the Alone in the Dark 3 intro and Carnby's arrival at Slaughter Gulch; Sark works through the saloon and projector setup, the cellar route and its hazards, then the jail escape, sheriff-badge and weapon puzzles before climbing to the rooftops","startSeconds":1933,"videoId":"z59F5mmGGK0"}],"title":"Saloon, Cellar & Jail"},{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_3_003_rooftops_hotel","segments":[{"endSeconds":15217,"label":"Carnby picks up the whip and crosses Slaughter Gulch's rooftop gauntlet through hangman ropes, scorpions, gunfire and explosives, then reaches the hotel for the cuckoo-clock, painting, flash and War Stick puzzles before dropping into the caverns below town","startSeconds":6556,"videoId":"z59F5mmGGK0"}],"title":"Rooftops & Hotel"},{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_3_004_underground_mansion","segments":[{"endSeconds":19280,"label":"Sark navigates the bat-filled underground passage and platforming route, uses the Indian amulet to progress, reaches the mansion, fights through its guards and searches the library and surrounding rooms for the books, clues and objects that open the next leg of the hunt for Emily","startSeconds":15217,"videoId":"z59F5mmGGK0"}],"title":"Underground Passage & Mansion"},{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_3_005_cemetery_ballroom_bank_setup","segments":[{"endSeconds":22090,"label":"The War Stick opens the cemetery sequence, leading into the Ace of Diamonds ritual and a return through the mansion; Sark works the ballroom and secret-route puzzles, the 30/30 bullet and hammer logic, the model-train and astronomy clues, and reaches the three-digit bank-code puzzle before saving for the night","startSeconds":19280,"videoId":"z59F5mmGGK0"}],"title":"Cemetery, Ballroom & Bank Setup"},{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_3_006_bank_train_station","segments":[{"endSeconds":7140,"label":"The run resumes from an earlier save, briefly replaying the mansion and code setup before Sark cracks 806, pushes through the bank sequence, recovers the stolen amulet, follows the minecart and railway route, demolishes the station and reaches the water-tower trap that sends Carnby into the land of the dead","startSeconds":2614,"videoId":"pNLUEcGoASs"}],"title":"Bank & Train Station"},{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_3_007_cougar_resurrection","segments":[{"endSeconds":8415,"label":"After Carnby's death, control shifts to his cougar form; Sark races the resurrection timer, works out the tar and silver-salts paw setup, fights the werewolves, returns to Carnby's body and restores him to human form","startSeconds":7140,"videoId":"pNLUEcGoASs"}],"title":"Cougar Resurrection"},{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_3_008_doppelganger_underground_mine","segments":[{"endSeconds":12194,"label":"Back in control of Carnby, Sark uses the soap in the doppelgänger and water-tower sequence, briefly takes cowboy form, uncovers the metallic-brush secret route, falls into the deep mine and follows Hutchinson's notes through the radioactive underground complex toward its laboratory","startSeconds":8874,"videoId":"pNLUEcGoASs"}],"title":"Doppelgänger & Underground Mine"},{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_3_009_radioactive_lab_spider","segments":[{"endSeconds":14000,"label":"The microscope and glass-plate clue open the laboratory stretch: Sark works through the colored-light and poison puzzles, the shrinking sequence, giant-spider encounter, glue-assisted climbing and the machinery around the underground works before reaching the next gunman","startSeconds":12194,"videoId":"pNLUEcGoASs"}],"title":"Radioactive Lab & Giant Spider"},{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_3_010_cobra_emily_jed_stone","segments":[{"endSeconds":17561,"label":"Sark clears the Cobra encounter and the final underground puzzles, reaches and wakes Emily with the ammonia, assembles the remaining tools for the escape, works through Jed Stone's water-and-electricity finale, powers the train route with coal, completes Alone in the Dark 3 and reacts through the credits before moving on","startSeconds":14000,"videoId":"pNLUEcGoASs"}],"title":"Cobra, Emily & Jed Stone"}],"id":"alone-in-the-dark-3-slaughter-gulch-run","title":"Slaughter Gulch Run"}],"id":"alone-in-the-dark-3","image":"https://static-cdn.jtvnw.net/ttv-boxart/6895_IGDB-210x280.jpg","searchTerms":["Alone in the Dark III","Alone in the Dark 3: Ghosts in Town"],"tags":["Survival Horror","Horror","Action","Singleplayer","Exploration","Inventory Management","Supernatural","Story","Puzzle","Western"],"title":"Alone in the Dark 3"},"clipCount":67}
